for i,z,e in [(0,'从两笔交易开始','Start with two trades'),(1,'把过去压缩成现金','Summarize the past as cash'),(2,'逐日现金实验','The daily cash experiment'),(3,'先预测，再揭晓','Predict before revealing'),(4,'证明与 Python','Proof and Python')]:c('s'+str(i),z,e)
c('statement','这一步要回答：已知每天的价格 [2,5,1,4]，最多两笔交易能赚多少？一笔交易是先买入再卖出；利润是卖价减买价，所有交易的利润相加。手里最多持有一股，必须先卖再买；也可以完全不交易。','Question: given daily prices [2,5,1,4], how much can at most two trades earn? A transaction is a buy followed by a sell. Profit is sale price minus purchase price, summed over trades. Hold at most one share and sell before buying again. Doing nothing is allowed.')
c('hand','第 1 天付 2，第 2 天收 5，赚 3；第 3 天付 1，第 4 天收 4，再赚 3。总利润 6。这里的天数从 1 开始；输入下标从 0 开始。两次买入并同时持有不合法；买 2 卖 5 再买 1 卖 4 合法。','Pay 2 on day 1, receive 5 on day 2: gain 3. Pay 1 on day 3, receive 4 on day 4: gain another 3. Total profit is 6. Teaching days start at 1; input indices start at 0. Buying twice and holding both shares is illegal; buying at 2, selling at 5, then buying at 1 and selling at 4 is legal.')
c('constraints','官方范围：1 ≤ n ≤ 100000，0 ≤ prices[i] ≤ 100000。无手续费、无冷却期；题目只要求最大利润整数，不要求交易日期。空数组不在官方范围内。','Official bounds: 1 ≤ n ≤ 100000 and 0 ≤ prices[i] ≤ 100000. No fee or cooldown is specified. Return the maximum integer profit, not the trade dates. Empty arrays are outside the official bounds.')
c('examples','官方示例：[3,3,5,0,0,3,1,4] → 6；[1,2,3,4,5] → 4；[7,6,4,3,1] → 0。','Official examples: [3,3,5,0,0,3,1,4] → 6; [1,2,3,4,5] → 4; [7,6,4,3,1] → 0.')
c('baseTitle','可靠但昂贵的起点','A reliable but costly baseline')
c('baseline','枚举一笔交易的买卖日，再枚举互不重叠的两笔交易：a < b < c < d。保留 0、单笔利润、双笔利润的最大值。下面的基线不修改输入，返回同一个利润整数；四层循环需要 O(n⁴) 时间、O(1) 额外空间。n 达到 100000 时不能逐个检查所有日期组合。','Enumerate single buy/sell pairs, then two nonoverlapping trades with a < b < c < d. Keep the maximum of zero, each single profit, and each pair of profits. This baseline leaves input unchanged and returns the same integer contract. Four loops cost O(n⁴) time and O(1) extra space; enumerating all date combinations is infeasible at n = 100000.')
c('wrong','诱人的错误：只取最大的两次相邻涨幅。[1,3,2,4,3,5] 的三次涨幅都是 2，这样只得 4；但买 1 卖 4（赚 3），再买 3 卖 5（赚 2），共 5。允许在小跌幅中继续持有，才能节省一次交易机会。','Tempting mistake: take the two largest adjacent rises. In [1,3,2,4,3,5], three rises each earn 2, so that rule returns 4. Buying at 1 and selling at 4 earns 3; buying at 3 and selling at 5 adds 2, totaling 5. Holding across a small dip can save a transaction slot.')
c('derive','这一步要回答：未来真的需要知道所有交易日期吗？先定义现金：从零开始，卖出收入减去买入支出，不含手中股票的价值。现金可为负数；持有时的现金不是已经结算的利润。','Question: does the future need every past trade date? Define cash as sale receipts minus purchase payments, starting from zero and excluding the value of a held share. Cash may be negative. Cash while holding a share is not realized profit.')
c('states','每处理一段天数，只保留四类历史的最大现金：h1 = 持有、最多买入一次；s1 = 空仓（不持股）、最多完成一笔；h2 = 持有、最多买入两次；s2 = 空仓、最多完成两笔。“最多”是额度，不是已完成次数；h2 也可代表只买过一次的历史。四个值可来自不同历史，不能当成同一条交易记录。','For each processed prefix of days, keep the greatest cash in four classes: h1 = holding, at most one buy; s1 = flat (no share), at most one completed trade; h2 = holding, at most two buys; s2 = flat, at most two completed trades. These are budgets, not exact action counts: h2 also includes histories with only one buy. The four maxima may come from different histories; they are not one trade log.')
c('deriveHand','仍看 [2,5,1,4]。第 1 天后 (h1,s1,h2,s2)=(-2,0,-2,0)。第 2 天卖出可得 -2+5=3，变为 (-2,3,-2,3)。第 3 天低价 1 到来：第一次买入可用 -1 替代 -2；第二次买入可用昨天的 3 支付 1，现金为 2，变为 (-1,3,2,3)。第 4 天卖出第二股得到 2+4=6，最终 (-1,3,2,6)。持股现金 2 为正，表示此前已赚的钱超过这次买价。','Stay with [2,5,1,4]. After day 1, (h1,s1,h2,s2)=(-2,0,-2,0). Selling on day 2 yields -2+5=3, giving (-2,3,-2,3). At price 1 on day 3, a first buy improves -2 to -1. A second buy can spend 1 from yesterday’s cash 3, leaving 2: (-1,3,2,3). Selling that share on day 4 yields 2+4=6, ending at (-1,3,2,6). Positive holding cash 2 means previous earnings exceed the new purchase price.')
c('recurrence','每一类都只比较“保持昨天”与“今天做最后一个动作”。价格为 p：h1 比较不变与 -p；s1 比较不变与旧 h1+p；h2 比较不变与旧 s1-p；s2 比较不变与旧 h2+p。不需要第 3 次买入，因为额度只有两次；空仓时不能卖、持股时不能再买。使用旧值让同一天只发生一个动作。若允许同日卖出再买入，同价下可合并这两笔而保持利润不变；同日买卖也无利润。因此这种写法不降低答案。','Each class compares “keep yesterday” with “make the last action today.” At price p: h1 compares staying with -p; s1 with old h1+p; h2 with old s1-p; s2 with old h2+p. There is no third buy because the budget is two. A flat history cannot sell, and a holding history cannot buy again. Reading old values permits only one action per day. If a sale and repurchase share a day, merge those trades at the same price without changing profit; a same-day buy/sell also earns zero. Thus this restriction does not reduce the answer.')
c('init','还没看价格时，空仓可以不交易，所以 s1=s2=0；持股不可能，所以 h1=h2=−∞（不可达的标记，不是真实亏损）。max 是取较大值。每一天都重复这种“按条件保留最大现金”的方法，这就是动态规划：保存足够的子问题答案，避免重算所有历史。','Before any price, doing nothing is flat, so s1=s2=0. Holding is impossible, so h1=h2=−∞, an unreachable marker rather than an actual loss. max chooses the larger value. Repeating this best-cash summary each day is dynamic programming: preserve sufficient answers for smaller prefixes instead of recomputing all histories.')
c('labTask','这一步要回答：今天的价格为什么会改变某个现金上限？选择预设会重置本实验。固定价格，逐日前进，先看“昨日 / 今天动作 / 今日”表，再看累计账本；后退应恢复同一组值。可用进度条直接回到任一天。','Question: why does today’s price change a cash maximum? Selecting a preset restarts this experiment. Keep prices fixed, advance by one day, compare “yesterday / action today / today,” then inspect the cumulative ledger. Rewind should restore the same values. The slider can seek to any day.')
c('labDefs','h1/h2：持股且最多买入 1/2 次的最大现金；s1/s2：空仓且最多完成 1/2 笔的最大现金。现金不含股票价值。−∞ 表示不可达。账本每行是一天全部更新后的状态；只有 s2 是当前已处理天数的最大已结算利润。','h1/h2: best cash while holding with at most 1/2 buys. s1/s2: best cash while flat with at most 1/2 completed trades. Cash excludes the share’s value; −∞ means unreachable. Each ledger row follows all updates for one day. Only s2 is the maximum realized profit for the processed prefix.')
c('simulation','这是 JavaScript 教学模拟，不是运行 Python 提交。保留完整历史需要 O(n) 教学空间；提交只需四个状态。所有预设均完整展示，无跳步。','This is a JavaScript teaching simulation, not execution of the Python submission. Keeping full history takes O(n) tutorial space; the submission retains four states. Every preset is shown completely, without skipped days.')
