c('answer','第 2 天最多一笔的空仓现金 s1=9−4=5。第 3 天以 2 买入，h2=max(旧 −4, 5−2)=3。−2 忽略了第一次卖出的利润；5 忽略了再次买入的支出。这里持有一股，3 不是最终利润。','After day 2, flat cash with at most one trade is s1=9−4=5. Buying at 2 on day 3 gives h2=max(old −4, 5−2)=3. −2 ignores the earlier sale profit; 5 ignores the new purchase payment. One share is still held, so 3 is not final profit.')
c('proof','这一步要回答：为什么四个数能保证最优？不变式是每处理完前 d 天，h1/h2 分别是最多买入 1/2 次且持股的最大现金，s1/s2 分别是最多完成 1/2 笔且空仓的最大现金。初始 0 与 −∞ 满足定义。对任一今日结束的合法历史：若今天没动作，它属于旧状态；若买入，它此前必为空仓；若卖出，它此前必持股。四个 max 恰好穷尽这些情况。','Question: why do four numbers guarantee the optimum? The invariant is that after d days, h1/h2 are maximum holding cash with at most 1/2 buys, and s1/s2 are maximum flat cash with at most 1/2 completed trades. Initial zero and −∞ satisfy the definitions. Any legal history ending today either takes no action and belongs to the old state, buys from a flat history, or sells from a holding history. The four max operations cover exactly these cases.')
c('sufficiency','为什么每类只留一个最大值？每个转移对来源类里的所有现金都加上或减去同一个价格，较小的来源值不可能生成更大的候选。因此这一步只需要来源类的最大值；逐日归纳即可。需要较少买入次数的历史仍由 h1/s1 单独保留，不能把四类合成一个最大现金。最后不持股才是完成交易的利润，所以返回 s2；“最多”已包含零笔与一笔。','Why keep one maximum per class? Each transition adds or subtracts the same price from every cash value in its source class. A smaller source value cannot produce a larger candidate, so only that class’s maximum is needed for the next step; induction repeats this argument daily. Histories using fewer buys remain separately represented in h1/s1: we cannot merge all four classes into one cash maximum. Completed-trade profit must finish flat, so return s2; its “at most” budget includes zero and one trade.')
c('map1','for p in prices：按时间处理；元组右侧全部读取昨日，避免覆盖依赖。','for p in prices scans chronologically; every tuple right-hand side reads yesterday, preserving dependencies.')
c('map2','max(h2, s1-p)：对应实验中第 3 天 max(-2,3-1)=2；max(s2,h2+p) 在次日把它变成利润 6。','max(h2, s1-p) maps to day 3 in the lab: max(-2,3-1)=2. On the next day max(s2,h2+p) turns that cash into profit 6.')
c('map3','初始化对应第 0 天；return s2 对应末日账本的最后一列。','Initialization is day 0; return s2 is the last column of the final ledger row.')
c('cost','n 天，每天四次常数时间比较：O(n) 时间、O(1) 额外空间；输入不修改，只返回一个整数。基线的 O(n⁴) 日期枚举被四个足够的前缀摘要替代。','For n days, four constant-time comparisons per day give O(n) time and O(1) auxiliary space. Input is unchanged and output is one integer. Four sufficient prefix summaries replace O(n⁴) date enumeration.')
c('boundaries','边界：只有一天、全相等、一直下跌均为 0，因为可以不交易；一直上涨只需一笔首买末卖。零价格可以直接买入，无除法。Python 整数无需取模；两笔最大利润不超过 200000。空数组防御性返回 0，但不属于官方输入。','Boundaries: one day, equal prices, and falling prices yield 0 because no trade is required. Rising prices need only one first-buy/last-sell trade. Zero prices allow buying normally; no division is used. No modulus is needed; two trades earn at most 200000. Empty input defensively returns 0 but is outside official constraints.')
